{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52541","headline":"故国山川写景 · 陈元光","name":"故国山川写景","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮光昂岳望，固始秀民乡。\n第宅参文武，姻㜕半帝王。\n珠楼帘结绮，花苑水流香。\n礼节传家范，簪缨奕世芳。\n飞鞭驰道坦，聚盖艳阳光。\n箫鼓迎懽会，桐麻遣唁丧。\n勳臣扶景运，风树配天长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}